-- Map markers for three quests from Voldemar's list (bugs 8). Same style as the Testing the Wells markers: one area per
-- group of spawns (spawns within 120 yd of each other form a group), the outline of the group 15 yd wider (25 yd around a
-- lone spawn), and a small turn-in area on the quest ender. Safe to run more than once.
-- Morbent Fel (55, Duskwood): had only the turn-in, at Sven (311), and no area for Morbent Fel (1200). Now both, on the Duskwood map.
-- Death to the Dragonmaw (98291, Wetlands): every objective was a single point, so the map showed dots in the wrong places.
--   Now one area per camp of Dragonmaw Reclaimers (271351), Soulbinders (271348) and Infiltrators (271346).
-- Fire Hardened Mail (1701): had only the turn-in, at Furen Longbeard (5413) in Stormwind (now on the Stormwind map).
--   Now: Scorched Spider Fang from the Leech and Cave Stalkers (1111, 4040) in the Wetlands, Charred Horn from the Fledgling
--   and Young Chimaeras (4031, 4032) and Galvanized Horn from the Chimaera Matriarch (6167) in Stonetalon. The Vial of
--   Phlogiston comes from Roogug in Razorfen Kraul, which has no map in this client, so it gets no area.
DELETE FROM `quest_poi` WHERE `QuestID` IN (55,98291,1701);
DELETE FROM `quest_poi_points` WHERE `QuestID` IN (55,98291,1701);
